Package: projectData
Title: Deferred Access to Installed Data Collections
Version: 0.0.0.9999
Authors@R: 
    person("Brad", "Blaser", , "bradley.blaser@osumc.edu", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3168-5423"))
Description: Registers installed, documented data packages as named
    collections without reading their data, exposes objects through deferred
    bindings, resolves name conflicts through explicit primary and preference
    choices, keeps provenance, and offers a loader interface for resources
    that need format-specific restoration.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: utils, stats
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown, testthat (>= 3.2.0), tools, withr (>= 2.5.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/blaserlab/projectData
BugReports: https://github.com/blaserlab/projectData/issues
